msgstr "段差 %+.2f m"

#: addons/iso_orbit/ground_character/character_monitor.gd
msgid "sprint started"
msgstr "ダッシュ開始"

#: addons/iso_orbit/ground_character/character_monitor.gd
msgid "sprint ended"
msgstr "ダッシュ終了"

#: addons/iso_orbit/ground_character/character_monitor.gd
msgid "%.2f s"
msgstr "%.2f秒"

#: addons/iso_orbit/ground_character/character_monitor.gd
msgid "left foot"
msgstr "左足"

#: addons/iso_orbit/ground_character/character_monitor.gd
msgid "right foot"
msgstr "右足"

#: gdscript/ui/settings/settings_screen.gd
msgid " (%d Hz)"
msgstr " (%d Hz)"

#: gdscript/ui/settings/settings_screen.gd
msgid "With V-Sync there are never more frames than the monitor's refresh rate%s, and an FPS limit above it has no effect. The smoothest limits are those that divide this rate evenly."
msgstr "V-Syncでは、フレーム数がモニターのリフレッシュレート%sを超えることはなく、それより高いFPS上限は効果がありません。最も滑らかなのは、このレートを割り切れる上限値です。"

#: gdscript/ui/settings/settings_screen.tscn
msgid "Language"
msgstr "言語"

#: gdscript/main.tscn
msgid "Hold the left button and the hero runs after the cursor; let go, and it stops."
msgstr "左ボタンを押し続けると、主人公がカーソルを追って走ります。離すと止まります。"

#: gdscript/main.tscn
msgid "Hold the right button and move the mouse to turn the camera; the wheel lowers and raises it."
msgstr "右ボタンを押したままマウスを動かすとカメラが回ります。ホイールでカメラを上げ下げできます。"

#: gdscript/main.tscn
msgid "Hold the right button, then the left one: the hero runs where the camera looks."
msgstr "右ボタン、続けて左ボタンを押し続けると、主人公はカメラの向く方へ走ります。"

#: gdscript/main.tscn
msgid "While the hero runs after the cursor, hold the right button to look around: the run keeps its course."
msgstr "主人公がカーソルを追って走っている間に右ボタンを押し続けると、走る向きを保ったまま周りを見回せます。"

#: gdscript/main.tscn
msgid "Shift makes the hero run faster for as long as stamina lasts."
msgstr "Shiftを押すと、スタミナが続く限り主人公は速く走ります。"

#: gdscript/main.tscn
msgid "F10 opens the settings: controls, camera, display, sound and more."
msgstr "F10で設定を開きます：操作、カメラ、表示、サウンドなど。"

#: gdscript/ui/travel_prompt.gd
msgid "Teleport to %s"
msgstr "%sへテレポート"

#: shared/world/world.tscn
msgid "Lonely Isle"
msgstr "孤島"

#: shared/world/island/island.tscn
msgid "Green Vale"
msgstr "緑の谷"

